          "gloss": "Shamir (of Ephraim)",
          "description": "A town in the hill country of the territory of Ephraim; residence of Tola, son of Puah, judge of Israel."
        }
      ]
    },
    "arb": {
      "preferred_label": "شامير (أفرايم)",
